                            'Տառերի չափ',
                            style: TextStyle(
                              fontSize: 18,
                              fontWeight: FontWeight.w600,
                              color: isDark ? Colors.white : Colors.black,
                            ),
                          ),
                        ],
                      ),
                    ),
                    Padding(
                      padding: const EdgeInsets.symmetric(horizontal: 20),
                      child: Row(
                        children: [
                          Text(
                            'Ա',
                            style: TextStyle(
                              fontSize: 14,
